    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n19"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i15: Also, create a material report."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct one-to-one mapping of the reporting task."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n20"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "i16: Once the report is created, send it to the warehouse."
